<#ffd264>STRIKERS  (ASSISTS)</>
Call Cure White		^X
Call Shiny Luminous		_F^X
  Needs that partner's standby gauge full. One partner out
  at a time.
Precure Attack (on hit)		^X / _F^X
  During some attacks that hit: the partner joins the combo.
  Costs 300 of her action gauge.
Precure Protection (blocking)		^X / _F^X
White: Attack / Low / Forward		^X / _D^X / _F^X
Luminous: Barrier (hold)		^X
Send Back / Retreat		_B^X
Rescue (partner down nearby)		^X

<#ffd264>SYSTEM</>
  Cure Black keeps her own Z button and burst.
Precure Burst (while being hit)		^Z
  Uses one burst gauge stock.
Boost Jump		^Z
Boost Dash		_F^Z
  Then A (mash), B or C for a Boost Attack.
Charge (hold)		_D^Z
Emergency Evade		_B^Z
Throw (close)		_F^A / _B^A
Precure Support (1 bar)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Needs a Precure Support gauge stock.
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
High Jump		_D_U
Just Guard (just before a hit)		_B

<#ffd264>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Heel Drop		_F^C
Sliding Kick (during dash)		_DF^C
Smash Upper (can charge)		^A_+^B
Smash Attack (can charge)		^B_+^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Flying Kick (air)		_D^B
Down Thrust (air)		_D^C

<#ffd264>SPECIALS</>
Leaping Ground Punch		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Ground Quake		_D_D^A / ^B / ^C

<#ffd264>SUPERS</>
Leaping Ground Punch EX (1 bar)		_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Ground Quake EX (1 bar)		_D_D^A_+^B
